SFG/DFG tests for WaveT
=======================

This directory holds regression tests for the SFG/DFG binary
(`make_sfg_dfg.x`), including multi-angle polarization sampling (`Nangles`).

Contents
--------
- `test_Nangles/`  Minimal Nangles smoke test (tiny CI, short trajectory).
  Designed to run quickly inside the global `make` test suite.

How to run everything
---------------------
From the repository's `WaveT/tests` directory:

```bash
cd WaveT/tests
export WAVET_PROGRAM_PATH=$(cd ../bin && pwd)

# Compiler modules depend on your cluster; example (Intel MPI):
module purge
module load slurm
module load intel-2024.2.0/intel_Comps-2024.2
module load intel-2024.2.0/intel_MPI-2024.2
module load intel-2024.2.0/intel_MKL-2024.2
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
export I_MPI_FABRICS=shm:ofi

make            # runs all test modules, including SFG_DFG
```

How to run only SFG/DFG
-----------------------
```bash
cd WaveT/tests/SFG_DFG
export WAVET_PROGRAM_PATH=$(cd ../../bin && pwd)
# load the same modules as above
make
```

Or a single case:
```bash
cd WaveT/tests/SFG_DFG/test_Nangles
export WAVET_PROGRAM_PATH=$(cd ../../../bin && pwd)
make
cat test_report.txt
```

Notes
-----
- The SFG/DFG binary needs a multiple of 4 MPI ranks (four Stokes signs).
  The harness launches `mpirun -np 4 make_sfg_dfg.x`.
- Numerical references live in `test_Nangles/ref/` (not only in `out/`),
  because the binary itself writes into `out/`.
- Large production runs (big CI, long `n_step`, batch submission) are outside
  this lightweight suite.
